3 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3782em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">语言模型</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>错误模型描述「正确的词会被写成什么」，语言模型描述「什么 query 更常见」。工程实践中语言模型的权重更高、也更可靠，因为它可以用搜索日志直接估计：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(q&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 就是该 query 在日志中的出现频率（或点击频次）。</p>\n<p>纯频率有一个明显缺陷：常见词会压倒一切。这会诱发经典的误纠——用户搜一个冷门但正确的型号 <code>WH-1000XM4</code>，模型因为 <code>WH-1000XM5</code> 更常见而把它改掉。必须引入<strong>上下文约束</strong>来抑制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>品牌与型号词典保护</strong>：命中已知品牌/型号词典的 query 或 token 直接标为「不可纠」。这是最有效的单一护栏，因为大部分高价值误纠都发生在品牌与型号上。</li>\n<li><strong>类目一致性</strong>：候选纠错结果若导致类目预测显著变化（例如从「户外装备」跳到「宠物用品」），则降低置信度。这一步复用了 <a href=\"../intent-taxonomy/category-prediction\">品类预测与类目直达</a> 的输出。</li>\n<li><strong>商品侧验证</strong>：候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在索引中的可召回商品数是一个强信号。若原 query 有结果、纠错后结果骤减，通常说明不该纠。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这几类约束组合后，最终决策变量是「纠错收益」而非「纠错概率」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>recall</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>category</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(q \\to q&#x27;) = \\log P(q&#x27;) - \\log P(q) + \\alpha \\cdot \\Delta\\text{recall} + \\beta \\cdot \\Delta\\text{category}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recall</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">category</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过阈值（且各护栏未否决）时才执行纠错。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>recall</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\text{recall}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recall</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>category</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\text{category}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">category</span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别表示召回量与类目一致性的变化，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是要在验证集上调的超参。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置信度分层与执行策略\">置信度分层与执行策略</h2><p>把置信度离散成三档，比用单一阈值更贴近业务实际：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>置信档</th>\n<th>判定条件</th>\n<th>执行动作</th>\n<th>用户可见性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高（&gt; 0.9）</td>\n<td>编辑距离 1、词典命中、类目不变</td>\n<td>静默替换 query</td>\n<td>无提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中（0.6–0.9）</td>\n<td>编辑距离 1–2、有行为信号支持</td>\n<td>替换但展示「已按 X 搜索」</td>\n<td>有提示与还原入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低（&lt; 0.6）</td>\n<td>编辑距离 ≥ 2 或护栏分歧</td>\n<td>不替换，改为「你是不是想搜 X」建议</td>\n<td>仅建议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中档的「替换 + 提示」是电商场景的关键设计。它把决策风险部分转移给用户，同时保留了召回改善的收益。提示文案必须包含<strong>一键还原</strong>，因为用户对系统擅自改词的容忍度很低。</p>\n<p>低档的「仅建议」则与零结果处理合流：当原 query 零结果而存在低置信候选时，无结果页展示候选建议是最自然的兜底形式。</p>\n<p>跨境场景下还需要按市场维护<strong>禁止纠错词表</strong>。不同市场的品牌代理名、区域性商品俗称差别很大，一套全局的禁纠表会失效。例如东南亚市场有大量本地品牌名与欧美品牌形近，全局禁纠表无法覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估-线上指标比线下准确率重要\">评估：线上指标比线下准确率重要</h2><p>拼写纠错的线下评估有标准做法：构造「错→对」测试集，看准确率与召回率。但这个指标与线上体验的关联很弱，原因是测试集的错误分布与真实日志差别巨大（测试集多为人工构造的整齐错误，真实日志是各种混杂错误）。</p>\n<p>有效的评估框架是<strong>替换实验（A/B）加上针对性代理指标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>期望方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纠错率</td>\n<td>被纠错的 query 占比</td>\n<td>稳定，突增即告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纠错后点击率</td>\n<td>纠错后 query 的 CTR vs 原 query</td>\n<td>显著提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误纠投诉率</td>\n<td>用户点击「还原」的比例</td>\n<td>越低越好，&gt; 5% 即需回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零结果率</td>\n<td>全站零结果 query 占比</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长尾 query 转化</td>\n<td>被纠错的 query 的转化率变化</td>\n<td>提升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中<strong>还原率</strong>是最灵敏的护栏指标。它直接反映了用户对纠错的接受度，任何纠错策略上线前都应当把还原率作为必看指标。</p>\n<p>一个常见的线上陷阱是<strong>纠错带来的指标虚高</strong>：如果纠错把 query 改成了热门词，点击率天然会高（热门词的结果更容易被点），这并不说明纠错有价值。正确的做法是对照「原 query 不做任何纠错」的对照组，而不是与「纠错后的热门词」自身的平均水平比较。这个偏差如果不处理，会系统性鼓励模型做激进纠错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>纠错模块的第一原则是误纠代价不对称，宁可漏纠不可误纠；系统形态因此是「候选生成器 + 置信度判别器」而非单一模型。</li>\n<li>候选生成有三条互补路径：编辑距离（对称删除索引）、形近与拼音（键盘邻接 + 拼音空间匹配）、模型生成（用日志挖掘的平行语料训练）。</li>\n<li>候选打分用噪声信道框架，但必须叠加品牌/型号保护、类目一致性、商品侧可召回数三类上下文约束，否则常见词会压倒正确的冷门词。</li>\n<li>置信度分三档执行：高置信静默纠、中置信纠+提示+还原入口、低置信仅建议（与零结果兜底合流）。</li>\n<li>跨境需按市场维护禁止纠错词表，变音符号恢复类问题归音译归一化处理。</li>\n<li>评估以还原率等线上护栏指标为主，注意「纠成热门词导致指标虚高」的偏差，对照组必须是原 query 而非热门词均值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>纠错之后若 query 仍然不完整，需要进入 <a href=\"query-rewrite-expand\">查询改写、补全与扩展</a>；纠错与属性抽取的交互（低置信品牌抽取提示原文可能有错）见 <a href=\"../intent-taxonomy/brand-attribute-extract\">品牌/型号/属性词抽取</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拼写纠错（词典+模型）与置信度","id":"拼写纠错-词典-模型-与置信度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：误纠代价不对称","id":"核心概念-误纠代价不对称"},{"level":2,"text":"候选生成：词典、形近与模型的三条互补路径","id":"候选生成-词典-形近与模型的三条互补路径"},{"level":2,"text":"候选打分：语言模型、行为信号与上下文约束","id":"候选打分-语言模型-行为信号与上下文约束"},{"level":2,"text":"置信度分层与执行策略","id":"置信度分层与执行策略"},{"level":2,"text":"评估：线上指标比线下准确率重要","id":"评估-线上指标比线下准确率重要"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"品牌/型号/属性词抽取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecommerce-query-understanding/intent-taxonomy/brand-attribute-extract"},"next":{"title":"查询改写、补全与扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecommerce-query-understanding/spelling-rewrite/query-rewrite-expand"}}